1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The silent type"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"July 1, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer.",{"children":["Untitled Sans began as an attempt to make another typeface plainer."]}],["$","p","1-Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after [reading about](https://khole.net/issues/youth-mode/) the [Super Normal project](https://jaspermorrison.com/exhibitions/2000-2009/super-normal) that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist.",{"children":["Kris Sowersby removed some of its more noticeable details, got a little lost and put the project away, came back to it several years later, and nearly threw it out. It was only after ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://khole.net/issues/youth-mode/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["reading about"]}]," the ",["$","a","3",{"href":"https://jaspermorrison.com/exhibitions/2000-2009/super-normal","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Super Normal project"]}]," that he found a way to understand the thing he’d already been making: maybe being deliberately ordinary was enough of a reason for a typeface to exist."]}],["$","p","2-I love that the explanation arrived late in the game, I can identify. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it.",{"children":["I love that the explanation arrived late in the game, I can identify. I try things. I change my mind. I forget why I started. I wander into something better. Occasionally I understand what I was doing after I’ve already done it."]}],["$","p","3-Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the [crime scene.](https://www.btp.police.uk/police-forces/british-transport-police/areas/about-us/about-us/our-history/crime-history/great-train-robbery/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)",{"children":["Sowersby describes deliberately removing traces of his own recognizable style from the letters, scrubbing his fingerprints off the ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://www.btp.police.uk/police-forces/british-transport-police/areas/about-us/about-us/our-history/crime-history/great-train-robbery/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","rel":"noreferrer","children":["crime scene."]}]]}],["$","p","4-That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist.",{"children":["That sounds almost perverse for a designer. We’re encouraged to make things distinctive, ownable, memorable—something that can stand up in a presentation and explain why it deserves to exist."]}],["$","p","5-But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me *read*.",{"children":["But most of the time, when I’m reading, I don’t need the typeface to introduce itself. I need it to help me ","$La","."]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"],"$Lf"]}],"$L10"]}]]}]}]
a:["$","em","1",{"children":"read"}]
b:["$","p","6-That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my [portfolio](http://maxpfennig.haus/) and for Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put.",{"children":["That’s probably why Untitled Sans feels right for both my ",["$","a","1",{"href":"http://maxpfennig.haus/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["portfolio"]}]," and for Thinkinghaus. The work and the writing can wander around and follow unusual ideas. The letters stay put."]}]
c:["$","p","7-Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention.",{"children":["Its plainness isn’t an absence of design. It’s what happens when a mountain of small decisions are made thoughtfully enough that they can recede. The type makes some room around the words instead of elbowing them for attention."]}]
d:["$","p","8-I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it.",{"children":["I find that deeply appealing: work that has clearly been thought about, but doesn’t make you stop every five minutes to admire how much thinking went into it."]}]
e:["$","p","9-Work that knows how to be quiet.",{"children":["Work that knows how to be quiet."]}]
